{"name": "Timefract", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Control Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Timefract</strong> is a puzzle game where <strong>time is a dimension you can move through</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel <strong>backward and forward</strong>, create clones of yourself across timelines, and solve challenges that would be impossible alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450670/extras/bda3e6437c0d2f8da76834e2b8832681.poster.avif?t=1777554014\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450670/extras/bda3e6437c0d2f8da76834e2b8832681.webm?t=1777554014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450670/extras/bda3e6437c0d2f8da76834e2b8832681.mp4?t=1777554014\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Every Move Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Timefract rewards precision and planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But failure is part of the process \u2014 refine your plan and try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450670/extras/2574591be42d82e5373d98edb0f48b26.poster.avif?t=1777554014\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450670/extras/2574591be42d82e5373d98edb0f48b26.webm?t=1777554014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450670/extras/2574591be42d82e5373d98edb0f48b26.mp4?t=1777554014\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Work With Your Past\u2026 and Your Future</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every action you take can become part of the solution.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rewind to recreate past movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move forward to align perfect timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create multiple versions of yourself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build solutions across timelines</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your clones repeat everything you did \u2014 turning your own actions into puzzle pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450670/extras/37e8c4e98015ba9b99a2ee1cb71dc947.poster.avif?t=1777554014\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450670/extras/37e8c4e98015ba9b99a2ee1cb71dc947.webm?t=1777554014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450670/extras/37e8c4e98015ba9b99a2ee1cb71dc947.mp4?t=1777554014\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Puzzles Built Around Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is designed to challenge how you think about cause and effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll interact with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pressure plates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lasers and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moving platforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pushable objects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple mechanics combine into <strong>complex, layered puzzles</strong> that require planning and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450670/extras/97b9aa669d9ac5306eddd0b9cb78acb7.poster.avif?t=1777554014\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450670/extras/97b9aa669d9ac5306eddd0b9cb78acb7.webm?t=1777554014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450670/extras/97b9aa669d9ac5306eddd0b9cb78acb7.mp4?t=1777554014\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Move through time. Back and forward. Create clones across timelines and cooperate with yourself to solve impossible puzzles.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450670/4730bb0c9b913e49f5d941a69b7480503efd823b/header.jpg?t=1777554014", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Puzzle", "3D Platformer", "Puzzle Platformer", "Time Management", "3D"], "developers": "alteemor", "publishers": "alteemor", "release_date": "Apr 30, 2026", "price": "$3.00", "appid": "4450670", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "7 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/hQoYywIrqSk", "first_seen": 1775520000.0, "review_rank": 872}